<Project name="azeroot_ronim">
    <Package name="main">
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_aceMaskMode">
            <English>ACE NVG mask handling</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_aceMaskMode_desc">
            <English>Only with ACE Nightvision loaded, which draws its own static tube mask.\nRONIM mask hides the ACE mask; ACE mask keeps ACE's and turns RONIM's off (no tube sway); Both draws both.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_aceMaskMode_opt0">
            <English>RONIM mask</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_aceMaskMode_opt1">
            <English>ACE mask</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_aceMaskMode_opt2">
            <English>Both</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_adsAimMult">
            <English>Weapon sway multiplier</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_adsAimMult_desc">
            <English>Weapon sway multiplier while aiming through a magnified optic with NVGs on (uses ACE sway factors with ACE).\n1.0 = no change, 1.5 = 50% more sway.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_adsSwayEnabled">
            <English>Independent ADS sway</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_adsSwayEnabled_desc">
            <English>While aiming through a magnified optic with NVGs on, the tube sways on its own, out of step with the\nweapon, and recoil kicks it. Only while aiming through a magnified optic (above the General magnification threshold) with NVGs on.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_adsSwayStrength">
            <English>ADS sway strength</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_adsSwayStrength_desc">
            <English>Size of the independent tube sway while aiming.\n2.0 = twice the movement, 0 = none.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_allowVehicles">
            <English>Apply in FFV seats</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_allowVehicles_desc">
            <English>Also apply RONIM to players who can use their weapon from a vehicle seat (FFV, turned out).\nOff = only on foot.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_attr_exempt">
            <English>RONIM: exempt</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_attr_exempt_desc">
            <English>This unit gets no RONIM night vision effects.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_autoDetectIntegrated">
            <English>Auto-detect integrated NV optics</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_autoDetectIntegrated_desc">
            <English>Optics whose own vision modes include NVG or thermal never get the optic features.\nOff = only the Classes &gt; Integrated NV optics list counts.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_bruiseChance">
            <English>Bruise chance per shot</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_bruiseChance_desc">
            <English>Chance that one shot bruises you (outside the cooldown).</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_bruiseCooldown">
            <English>Bruise cooldown</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_bruiseCooldown_desc">
            <English>Minimum seconds between two bruises.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_bruiseDamage">
            <English>Bruise damage</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_bruiseDamage_desc">
            <English>Damage of one bruise. ACE: below 0.35 gives a contusion.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_bruiseEnabled">
            <English>Recoil bruising</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_bruiseEnabled_desc">
            <English>Shots can knock the NVG into your face and bruise your head (ACE medical: contusion). Only while aiming through a magnified optic (above the General magnification threshold) with NVGs on.</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_bruiseRecoilScale">
            <English>Scale with recoil</English>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_azeroot_ronim_main_bruiseRecoilScale_desc">
            <English>Powerful rounds bruise more often and harder.</English>
        </Key>
